SUMMARY:Animal Body - Ecstatic Dance Waves w/ Kristikka
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nSunday\, October 25th\n1st Danc
 e Wave 8:30\\-10:30am \\| Warmup 8:30am \\| Opening Circle 9am\n2nd Dance 
 Wave 10:30\\-12:30am \\| Warmup 10:30am \\| Opening Circle 11am\nFacilitat
 or Kristikka (Kris Hostikka)\n\nIntention: Animal Body\n\nCome as you are\
 , soft animal of the world. Your animal body is calling\, and it has been 
 patient\, waiting beneath the noise of your days\, ears pricked\, nose to 
 the wind. How does it want to move you? Perhaps it wants to sway like tall
  grass\, to prowl\, to shake the dust from its fur\, to fold itself small 
 and then burst open like a startled flock of birds. Your animal body isn
 ’t the place from which you do matrixy things. It doesn’t own a credit
  card. It has never once checked an inbox\, never worried about being late
 . It knows only hunger and rest\, the pull of the moon\, the holy ache to 
 stretch and howl and be warm among others. So what sounds does your animal
  want to make? Let them rise from the belly\, from the old forest in your 
 bones: the growl\, the sigh\, the wild syllables that no language has caug
 ht. Give yourself the freedom to express this instinctual part of who you 
 are\, while holding the utmost respect for the sacred creatures dancing ar
 ound you. Let us be a herd\, a pack\, a murmuration. Come home to your wil
 dness. The meadow is open\, and your name is already being called.\n\n## A
 bout Kristikka\n\nKristikka loves creating a sacred container that takes y
 ou on an inward journey utilizing rhythm to move us from quiet embodiment 
 to chaos and down into stillness and integration. She feels that movement 
 is medicine\, weaving intention and a rich blend of world beats where it
 ’s possible to be with what is and open to what wants to be seen\, felt 
 and moved. You can find her dance mixes here:[ ](http://soundcloud.com/dj-
 kristikka) [http://soundcloud.com/dj-kristikka](http://soundcloud.com/dj-k
 ristikka)\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please note that the dance starts at Warm u
 p. The doors close promptly at Opening Circle and any that come late will 
 be turned away. Please be on time to ensure a safe and secure container. \
 \*\\*\nTicket Prices: $15 - $30 or name your price.\n\nNo one turned away 
 for lack of funds!\nPre-registration Recommended:\n\nVOLUNTEER!\n\nWe need
  volunteers. Volunteer and dance for free! Register to volunteer at:\n[htt
 ps://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/](https://ashevillemovement
 collective.org/volunteer/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam1
 0YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgU
 cbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nIMPORTANT
  ANNOUNCEMENTS:\n\nDoor will close at the beginning of the opening circle.
  Please note: NO ENTRY AFTER OPENING CIRCLE BOTH WAVES!\n\nCollective agre
 ements:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/](https://ashe
 villemovementcollective.org/our-dance/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMF
 ZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1X
 AETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)
 \n\nAbout AMC:\nAsheville Movement Collective envisions a world that moves
  in harmony where all are free to be their authentic selves within a lovin
 g community. Our mission and aim are to inspire authenticity and healthy c
 ommunity through free-form dance by hosting dance waves for personal and c
 ommunity transformation. AMC is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization.\n\nLoc
 ation: 50 Bell Rd\, Asheville\, NC 28805\n\nSee you on the dance floor!
