SUMMARY:When People Keep Running... - Ecstatic Dance Wave w/ Ted Riskin
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nFriday\, October 30th\nEvening 
 Dance Wave 7:00 pm \\- 9:00 pm \\| Warmup 7pm \\| Opening Circle 7:30pm\nF
 acilitator Ted Riskin\n\nIntention: When People Keep Running\, Something K
 eeps Chasing Them\n\nCostumes optional and welcome.\n\n## About Ted Riskin
 \n\nTed is interested in anything that can get him out of his head\, and m
 usic and movement do a pretty good job of that. He hopes to offer music th
 at facilitates an inner journey and invitations that create a shift. While
  he likes modern electronic music\, he can’t create a mix without includ
 ing lots of natural instruments and voices. Due to a short attention span\
 , he mixes in lots of different musical genres. You can hear some of his m
 ixes on [https://www.mixcloud.com/tarisk/](https://www.mixcloud.com/tarisk
 /)\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please note that the dance starts at Warm up. Th
 e doors close promptly at Opening Circle and any that come late will be tu
 rned away. Please be on time to ensure a safe and secure container. \\*\\*
 \nTicket Prices: $15 - $30 or name your price.\n\nNo one turned away for l
 ack of funds!\nPre-registration Recommended:\n\nVOLUNTEER!\n\nWe need volu
 nteers. Volunteer and dance for free! Register to volunteer at:\n[https://
 ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/](https://ashevillemovementcolle
 ctive.org/volunteer/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0
 RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_
 LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nIMPORTANT ANNO
 UNCEMENTS:\n\nDoor will close at the beginning of the opening circle. Plea
 se note: NO ENTRY AFTER OPENING CIRCLE BOTH WAVES!\n\nCollective agreement
 s:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/](https://asheville
 movementcollective.org/our-dance/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0Z
 zTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8
 I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nA
 bout AMC:\nAsheville Movement Collective envisions a world that moves in h
 armony where all are free to be their authentic selves within a loving com
 munity. Our mission and aim are to inspire authenticity and healthy commun
 ity through free-form dance by hosting dance waves for personal and commun
 ity transformation. AMC is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization.\n\nLocation
 : 50 Bell Rd\, Asheville\, NC 28805\n\nSee you on the dance floor!
