SUMMARY:Who Lights The Sun - Ecstatic Dance Waves w/ Eduardo Arias
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nSunday\, November 1st\n1st Danc
 e Wave 8:30\\-10:30am \\| Warmup 8:30am \\| Opening Circle 9am\n2nd Dance 
 Wave 10:30\\-12:30am \\| Warmup 10:30am \\| Opening Circle 11am\nAuxiliary
  Facilitator Eduardo Arias\n\nIntention: Who Lights The Sun\n\nEverything 
 is vibration. Every atom\, every heartbeat\, every thought hums at its own
  frequency. And light is what lets a frequency rise.\nWe look up at the su
 n and assume it burns on its own.\nBut nothing shines alone. Somewhere bel
 ow\, a single ember sends its warmth upward in a thousand quiet threads. E
 ach thread is a signal\, a pulse of energy that lifts the sun higher. The 
 sun is only as bright as the light it receives.\nWe are the same. We don
 ’t climb to a higher frequency by force. We get tuned there by light: a 
 person who sees us clearly\, a sound that cracks something open\, a moment
  of stillness\, a memory that still glows. Light carries everything a body
  needs to vibrate higher. It brings warmth\, clarity\, direction\, and the
  courage to keep burning when the world goes dark.\nWithout it\, we fall q
 uiet. With it\, we resonate.\nThis wave is for the ember behind your sun. 
 It’s for the source you rarely name but always feel. Follow the threads 
 down and you’ll find it.\nThen ask yourself\, and mean it: who lights yo
 u?\nAnd whose sun are you lighting?\n\n## About Eduardo Arias\n\nEduardo's
  mixes can be found here:[ soundcloud.com/user-597811949](https://soundclo
 ud.com/user-597811949)\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please note that the dance sta
 rts at Warm up. The doors close promptly at Opening Circle and any that co
 me late will be turned away. Please be on time to ensure a safe and secure
  container. \\*\\*\nTicket Prices: $15 - $30 or name your price.\n\nNo one
  turned away for lack of funds!\nPre-registration Recommended:\n\nVOLUNTEE
 R!\n\nWe need volunteers. Volunteer and dance for free! Register to volunt
 eer at:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/](https://ashe
 villemovementcollective.org/volunteer/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMF
 ZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1X
 AETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)
 \n\nIMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENTS:\n\nDoor will close at the beginning of the op
 ening circle. Please note: NO ENTRY AFTER OPENING CIRCLE BOTH WAVES!\n\nCo
 llective agreements:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/]
 (https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CM
 TAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4
 XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1
 pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nAbout AMC:\nAsheville Movement Collective envisions a wor
 ld that moves in harmony where all are free to be their authentic selves w
 ithin a loving community. Our mission and aim are to inspire authenticity 
 and healthy community through free-form dance by hosting dance waves for p
 ersonal and community transformation. AMC is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organiz
 ation.\n\nLocation: 50 Bell Rd\, Asheville\, NC 28805\n\nSee you on the da
 nce floor!
